      {
        "text": "He says golden needle Gu combined with create fog Gu can form golden fog. He says this golden fog looks faint and weak, but is actually extremely powerful and is specialized in breaking through a Gu Master’s defense. He adds that when he was twenty-eight and roaming Southern Border, he used this move to dominate the region of Luchuan river.",
